/* 项目工作区（v13）：与创作工作台同一套视觉语言（暖色 + 强调金，卡 20 / 控件 14 / 胶囊 999）。 */

/* 步骤条层级（立项页复用） */
.step { padding-top: 26rpx; margin-top: 26rpx; border-top: 1rpx solid var(--line); }
.step-head { display: flex; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 16rpx; }
.step-bar {
  width: 6rpx; height: 24rpx; border-radius: 3rpx; background: var(--gold);
  margin-right: 12rpx; flex-shrink: 0; align-self: center;
}
.step-t { font-size: 28rpx; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); }
.step-cap { font-size: 22rpx; color: var(--ink-faint); margin-left: 12rpx; }
.studio-submit { margin-top: 30rpx; }
.textarea.small { min-height: 140rpx; }

/* 图片素材格 */
.mat-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.mat-cell { position: relative; width: 150rpx; height: 150rpx; margin: 0 14rpx 14rpx 0; }
.mat-thumb { width: 150rpx; height: 150rpx; border-radius: var(--radius-ctl); background: #f0ebe0; }
.mat-add {
  width: 150rpx; height: 150rpx; border-radius: var(--radius-ctl); border: 2rpx dashed var(--line);
  background: var(--field-bg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: 40rpx;
}
.mat-add-t { font-size: 22rpx; margin-top: 2rpx; }
.mat-spin {
  position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; background: rgba(42, 36, 29, 0.62); color: #fff;
  font-size: 20rpx; text-align: center; padding: 6rpx 0; border-radius: 0 0 var(--radius-ctl) var(--radius-ctl);
}
.mat-del {
  position: absolute; right: -12rpx; top: -12rpx; width: 44rpx; height: 44rpx; line-height: 42rpx;
  text-align: center; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55); color: #fff; border-radius: 50%; font-size: 24rpx;
}
.asset-kind {
  position: absolute; left: 8rpx; top: 8rpx; background: rgba(42, 36, 29, 0.68); color: #f4e8d0;
  font-size: 18rpx; border-radius: 8rpx; padding: 2rpx 10rpx;
}

/* 语音 */
.voice-row { display: flex; align-items: stretch; gap: 16rpx; }
.voice-btn {
  width: 168rpx; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  background: var(--ink); color: #f4e8d0; font-size: 26rpx; border-radius: var(--radius-ctl);
  -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;
}
.voice-btn.rec { background: var(--rust); animation: rec-pulse 1s ease-in-out infinite; }
@keyframes rec-pulse { 0%, 100% { opacity: 1; } 50% { opacity: 0.75; } }
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .voice-btn.rec { animation: none; } }
.voice-area { flex: 1; min-height: 160rpx; }
.voice-ops { margin-top: 12rpx; }
.prompt-ops { margin-top: 8rpx; }

/* 跑一步 */
.run-row { margin-top: 8rpx; }
.run-row button { margin: 0; }

/* 步骤时间线 */
.pstep { padding: 20rpx 0; border-top: 1rpx solid var(--line); }
.pstep:first-of-type { border-top: none; }
.pstep .err { color: var(--rust); }
.st-video { width: 100%; height: 420rpx; border-radius: var(--radius-ctl); margin-top: 14rpx; background: #000; }

.w-ops { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12rpx; margin-top: 14rpx; }
.w-ops button { margin: 0; }
.chip {
  font-size: 22rpx; color: var(--ink-soft); background: #fff; border: 1rpx solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 999rpx; padding: 8rpx 22rpx; line-height: 1.5;
}
.chip:active { background: var(--field-bg); }
.approve { background: var(--gold); color: #fff; margin-left: auto; }

/* 标签配色：步骤类型 / 任务状态 / 项目状态 */
.kind-storyboard { background: #e8e2f2; color: #4c3a6b; }
.kind-video { background: #dfe9dc; color: #2f5d3a; }
.kind-copy { background: #f6e3c8; color: #7a5a17; }
.ts-pending { background: #f8efcf; color: #8a6b1d; font-weight: 600; }
.ts-running { background: #f8efcf; color: #8a6b1d; }
.ts-done { background: #dde8d0; color: #3f5a2a; }
.ts-failed { background: #ecd6d0; color: #7a3a2a; }
.ts-skipped { background: #eceae4; color: var(--ink-soft); }
.st-open { background: #f8efcf; color: #8a6b1d; font-weight: 600; }
.st-review { background: #dfe9dc; color: #2f5d3a; }
.st-done { background: #dde8d0; color: #3f5a2a; }
.st-archived { background: #eceae4; color: var(--ink-soft); }

/* 分镜弹层 */
.mask { position: fixed; top: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45); z-index: 100; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; }
.sheet { width: 100%; background: #fff; border-radius: 24rpx 24rpx 0 0; padding: 28rpx 28rpx calc(20rpx + env(safe-area-inset-bottom)); max-height: 86vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.sheet-head { margin-bottom: 20rpx; }
.sheet-body { flex: 1; min-height: 300rpx; max-height: 60vh; }
.sheet-foot { margin-top: 20rpx; }
.sb-area { min-height: 420rpx; font-family: monospace; font-size: 24rpx; }

/* 杂项 */
.flow-tip { margin-top: 10rpx; line-height: 1.6; }
.center { text-align: center; margin-top: 14rpx; }
.link { color: var(--gold); font-size: 24rpx; }

/* —— 出片引擎选择（v13.1） —— */
.rd-row { display: flex; gap: 16rpx; }
.rd {
  flex: 1; border: 2rpx solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-ctl);
  background: var(--field-bg); padding: 18rpx 20rpx; opacity: 0.7;
}
.rd.on { opacity: 1; border-color: var(--gold); background: #fbf5e8; }
.rd-name { font-size: 26rpx; font-weight: 600; }
.rd-tip { font-size: 21rpx; color: var(--ink-soft); margin-top: 6rpx; line-height: 1.5; }
.eng { background: #e8e2f2; color: #4c3a6b; }
